{"sha": "3b14398ef2de69faa7b3e7336262e45f7a5648f09d4c9f93c336eea64b31d985", "body": ["{\\small 抛出小球的频闪照片：$\\vect v_2$ 与 $\\vect", "v_4$ 由弦构造，并平移到 $M_3$；它们的差", "$\\Delta\\vect v$ 给出 $\\vect a$ --- 竖直向下。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{直线运动}", "", "沿直线运动时，一条坐标轴即可：$x(t)$，$v(t) = x'(t)$，", "$a(t) = v'(t)$，均为代数量。", "", "\\begin{definition}[匀速直线运动]\\label{def:g12:kinematics-2d:uniform}", "称某运动为\\emph{匀速直线运动}\\index{匀速直线", "运动}，当 $\\vect v$ 为常矢量时：轨迹为直线，", "速率恒定，$\\vect a = \\vect 0$。于是 $x(t) = v\\,t + x_0$。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[匀变速直线运动]\\label{prop:g12:kinematics-2d:uarm}", "\\index{匀变速直线运动}%", "若质点沿 $Ox$ 以\\emph{恒定}的加速度 $a$ 运动，", "从 $t = 0$ 时刻、位置 $x_0$ 处以速度 $v_0$ 出发，则", "\\[", "v(t) = a\\,t + v_0,", "\\qquad", "x(t) = \\tfrac12\\,a\\,t^2 + v_0\\,t + x_0 .", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$v$ 是常量 $a$ 的一个原函数：$v(t) = a t + C$，且", "由 $t = 0$ 得 $C = v_0$。进而 $x$ 是", "$a t + v_0$ 的一个原函数：$x(t) = \\tfrac12 a t^2 + v_0 t + C'$，其中 $C' = x_0$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, name=ax1, width=8.4cm, height=3.2cm,", "    ylabel={$x$ (\\unit{m})}, xmin=0, xmax=4, ymin=0, ymax=21]", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0:4, samples=40] {0.5*2*x^2 + x};", "\\end{axis}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, name=ax2, at={(ax1.below south west)},", "    anchor=north west, yshift=-3mm, width=8.4cm, height=3.2cm,", "    ylabel={$v$ (\\unit{m/s})}, xmin=0, xmax=4, ymin=0, ymax=10]", "  \\addplot[omThm, thick, domain=0:4, samples=2] {2*x + 1};", "\\end{axis}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, at={(ax2.below south west)}, anchor=north west,", "    yshift=-3mm, width=8.4cm, height=3.2cm, xlabel={$t$ (\\unit{s})},", "    ylabel={$a$ (\\unit{m/s^2})}, xmin=0, xmax=4, ymin=0, ymax=3]", "  \\addplot[omProp, thick, domain=0:4, samples=2] {2};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 匀变速直线运动（$a = \\qty{2.0}{m/s^2}$，", "$v_0 = \\qty{1.0}{m/s}$，$x_0 = 0$）：每幅图都是", "上方那幅图的导数 --- 抛物线、其斜率、斜率的斜率。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[制动距离]\\label{ex:g12:kinematics-2d:braking}", "一辆汽车以速率 $v_0$ 行驶，以恒定减速度 $a$ 制动", "（加速度为 $-a$）。停车时 $v(t) = -a t + v_0 = 0$，", "即 $t_s = v_0/a$ 时，已行驶距离为 $d = -\\tfrac12 a t_s^2 + v_0 t_s =", "v_0^2/(2a)$。平方关系是道路安全的核心结论：速率加倍，", "制动距离\\emph{变为四倍} --- 取 $a =", "\\qty{6.0}{m/s^2}$ 时，制动距离为 \\qty{16}{m}（自 \\qty{50}{km/h} 起），", "为 \\qty{64}{m}（自 \\qty{100}{km/h} 起）。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{匀速圆周运动与弗勒内标架}", "", "\\begin{definition}[匀速圆周运动]\\label{def:g12:kinematics-2d:ucm}", "称某运动为\\emph{匀速圆周运动}\\index{匀速圆周运动}，", "当其轨迹为半径为 $R$ 的圆且速率 $v$ 恒定时，", "绕行一圈所用的时长称为\\emph{周期}\\index{周期!转动} $T$，", "而\\emph{频率}\\index{频率!", "转动} $f = 1/T$（单位为 \\unit{Hz}）是每秒绕行的圈数：", "$v = 2\\pi R/T = 2\\pi R f$.", "\\end{definition}", "", "速率恒定 --- 然而速度在转动：此处\\emph{确实}存在", "一个加速度。方向如何？大小又是多少？", "", "\\begin{theorem}[向心加速度]\\label{thm:g12:kinematics-2d:centripetal}", "\\index{向心加速度}%", "在半径为 $R$、速率为 $v$ 的匀速圆周运动中，", "这一加速度 --- 称为\\emph{向心}加速度 --- 方向由运动质点", "指向圆心，其模为常量：", "\\[", "a = \\frac{v^2}{R}.", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "以圆心为原点建立坐标轴，并令 $\\omega = v/R$，于是", "弧长 $v t$ 所对圆心角为 $\\omega t$，故位置为", "$x(t) = R\\cos(\\omega t)$，$y(t) = R\\sin(\\omega t)$。求导得", "$\\vect v = (-R\\omega\\sin(\\omega t),\\, R\\omega\\cos(\\omega t))$，其模", "恒为 $R\\omega = v$；再次求导得", "$\\vect a = -\\omega^2\\,\\vect{OM}$，方向与位置矢量", "相反 --- 指向圆心 --- 其模为 $\\omega^2 R = v^2/R$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.0, font=\\small]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) circle (1.7);", "  \\fill (0,0) circle (1.5pt); \\node[below left] at (0,0) {$O$};", "  \\draw[dashed, omExo] (0,0) -- (215:1.7)", "    node[midway, below right] {$R$};", "  \\fill (35:1.7) circle (2pt); \\node[above right] at (35:1.7) {$M$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, thick] (35:1.7) -- ++(-0.69,0.98)", "    node[above] {$\\vect v$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, very thick] (35:1.7) -- ++(215:0.95)", "    node[below right] {$\\vect a$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}